  <item>
    <title>049. 童年夏天的快乐降落到现在也不正不偏</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a72b0d8ab3a91c24a1006b3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a72b0d8ab3a91c24a1006b3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>想到夏天，你会一首歌、一种香气、还是一个味道？</span></p><p><span>前几天我回家的路上，突然很抗拒在28度的夏日微风里走进地铁站，不想走进那个铁笼子里，而错过今晚的日落。于是突然想来聊那些我们喜欢的夏日时刻！</span></p><p><span>祝大家剩余夏天的日子都又脆又甜～</span></p><p><span>🎧</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a> 总是让人挪不开眼的黄金八点档</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a> 像果蝇一样扑向有空调的地方</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 夏天是每天期待吃到「好多鱼」的日子</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 嘎嘎女士和陈奕迅的公鸡头</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a> 世界上拥有新疆大西瓜的地方竟然不止一个</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2137">35:37</a> 我就是我妈艾灸炼丹的试验田</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2405">40:05</a> 那些年的我背过的洗米水黑锅</span></p><p><span>谢谢你们的收听，期待下次见面!</span></p><p><span>主播｜</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a40209e4eacab17d96b54bf" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a40209e4eacab17d96b54bf"><span>东西南北人er</span></a><span>，再想想bo</span><br><span>音乐署名｜ Roma by VDGL (</span><a href="http://soundcloud.com" data-url="http://soundcloud.com"><span>soundcloud.com</span></a><span>)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/662c256717d801ae7c8b5c64/lkP5V4iZnKPYXAXbPv2P-2Stc472.m4a" length="47920936" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm2y7Y-wdglQZaoR2VHt1gc9kplk.jpg"/>
