  <item>
    <title>046. 莎士比亚文字里的小注脚，藏着他最难以启齿的伤痕</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a30d02a4233e62bc54aa2b3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a30d02a4233e62bc54aa2b3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如果你曾在上半年路过电影院，很难不注意到一对男女相拥的电影海报，名字叫哈姆奈特。</span><br><span>哈姆奈特？哈姆雷特？这个名字实在让人困惑，而海报上的森林好像也和王子复仇记毫无关系。</span><br><span>看完以后，我和小so一致认同：无论带着怎样的心情走进这部片子，你都会忘记所有具体，眼前都只剩下那澎湃的绿和爱意。</span></p><p><span>🎧</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 没有套路，全是情感 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">09:12</a> 大片澎湃的绿意和先声夺人的镜头 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1028">17:08</a> 原来莎士比亚也有个有毒的原生家庭 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> 大多数人都是月球，但艾格尼丝像太阳一样灿烂 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">24:34</a> 人只能从自己拥有的视角来观察世界 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1834">30:34</a> 伟大的、坚韧的、充满生命力的艾格尼丝 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2054">34:14</a> 我们就一直刷小红书到它过气的那天 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2287">38:07</a> 藏在历史的注脚里的那些小人物</span></p><p><span>谢谢你们的收听，期待下次见面! </span><br><span>主播｜</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a40209e4eacab17d96b54bf" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a40209e4eacab17d96b54bf"><span>东西南北人er</span></a><span>，再想想bo </span><br><span>音乐署名｜ Roma by VDGL (</span><a href="http://soundcloud.com" data-url="http://soundcloud.com"><span>soundcloud.com</span></a><span>)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/662c256717d801ae7c8b5c64/lloXYBadDA_FZES_DIWMasz3Ki7L.m4a" length="43128537" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm2y7Y-wdglQZaoR2VHt1gc9kplk.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>46</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
