  <item>
    <title>042. 我遇见你就像苏轼遇见了张怀民</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d476c4e2c8be31558aa9cc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d476c4e2c8be31558aa9cc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我和小so的相遇，仿佛是苏轼找到了张怀民。然而最严重的副作用，竟然是发现交朋友越来越难！</span><br><span>当然自醒一下，我们俩都是佛系得很，本着不行就算了、这玩意儿努力也没用，是宁缺毋滥。</span><br><span>那么咱俩就祝大家，和老友们的友谊像酒一样越酿越醇，然后也多多结交有趣的新人吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="272">04:32</a> 老友们从未离开，只是换了一个景深</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="542">09:02</a> 对过往时间的痛苦和感受全都与人相关</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="817">13:37</a> 长大之后，就没有人关心我们怎么交朋友了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 我那个最好的朋友的傻儿子</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1163">19:23</a> 我的天才女友：互为相爱相杀的东亚母亲</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a> 你和其余的一切：女性友谊里从不缺深刻的爱</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1659">27:39</a> 和我的白月光好朋友们比，其他人很难达到付出回报比</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> 生活中得到了太多NO，人也会变暴躁！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2269">37:49</a> 孟京辉的等待戈多和看电影交朋友哲学</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2587">43:07</a> 要像昆虫一样地释放信息素，然后等，愿者上钩！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2648">44:08</a> 我们需要一个世界友情日</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你们的收听，期待下次见面!</span><br><span>主播｜</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a40209e4eacab17d96b54bf" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a40209e4eacab17d96b54bf"><span>东西南北人er</span></a><span>，再想想bo</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐署名：</span><br><span>Roma by VDGL </span><a href="https://soundcloud.com/musicforall-61338549" data-url="https://soundcloud.com/musicforall-61338549"><span>soundcloud.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/662c256717d801ae7c8b5c64/luFeg_vvJtHaBH-UhevSeOMOplTY.m4a" length="45230054" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:34</itunes:duration>
