  <item>
    <title>036. 漂流过世界，再难说出具体的刻板印象</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69790e1c3cf2b0c01cee0a32</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69790e1c3cf2b0c01cee0a32</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Jan 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家有没有过很想把一顶帽子扣到一个人头上的时刻！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这顶帽子似乎都是源自于我们内心的刻板印象，而俺小so最近在各种文化的全方面冲击下，再次对于这个概念产生了思考。我们对于一个地域的认知，好像就在和身边擦肩而过的一个人的碰撞下，拉入谷底，但又在另一个路人掠过时，往上飘了几格。我们对于世界的认知就在身边每一颗粒子的涌动中波动变化。</span></p><span></span><p><span>哎呀，好像说奥妙了。不能再说了。</span><br><span>接下来，这是我们最近的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:16</a> 随地大小睡的人生技能大家值得拥有</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 这老师怎么暖暖的，但又假假和冷冷的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">17:54</a> 00后整顿职场，怎会险些将军失败</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1718">28:38</a> 英国付双倍工资都不愿离开的同事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1892">31:32</a> “这人好像根蔗”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2182">36:22</a> 中巴果然是老祖宗严选的好朋友！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2516">41:56</a> 当年查字典的时候，也没人告诉我这名字还有这意思啊</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2869">47:49</a> 香港艺术馆的周边都是八字护身符</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2924">48:44</a> 还在咒骂的so被倡导”为我所用“的bo按下不动了</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你们的收听，期待下次见面!</span><br><span>主播｜</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a40209e4eacab17d96b54bf" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a40209e4eacab17d96b54bf"><span>东西南北人er</span></a><span>，再想想bo</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐署名：</span><br><span>Roma by VDGL </span><a href="https://soundcloud.com/musicforall-61338549" data-url="https://soundcloud.com/musicforall-61338549"><span>soundcloud.com</span></a><br><span>Creative Commons — Attribution 3.0 Unported — CC BY 3.0F</span><br><span>ree Download / Stream: </span><a href="https://bit.ly/3EQLSTj" data-url="https://bit.ly/3EQLSTj"><span>bit.ly</span></a><br><span>Music promoted by Audio Library </span><a href="https://bit.ly/3Etp9N9" data-url="https://bit.ly/3Etp9N9"><span>bit.ly</span></a></p>]]></description>
